msgstr "https://beclicked.agency"

#. Description of the plugin
#: bca-media-cleaner.php
msgid ""
"Find the media and files your site no longer uses, and see how much disk "
"space you can recover. The analysis is read-only."
msgstr ""
"Repérez les médias et fichiers que votre site n'utilise plus, et voyez "
"combien d'espace disque vous pouvez récupérer. L'analyse est en lecture "
"seule."

#. Author of the plugin
#: bca-media-cleaner.php
msgid "Be Clicked Agency"
msgstr "Be Clicked Agency"

#: bca-media-cleaner.php:55
msgid ""
"BCA Media Cleaner does not support multisite networks yet. The plugin is "
"inactive on this installation."
msgstr ""
"BCA Media Cleaner ne prend pas encore en charge les réseaux multisites. "
"L'extension reste inactive sur cette installation."

